      "content": "hey, i'm having a really intense headache right now. it came on super fast and parts of it feel weird... like my left arm is kinda heavy and weak, and my vision in my left eye is all blurry. i get really bad migraines sometimes, so i'm wondering if this is just a typical migraine aura or something else? it's kinda scary but i'm hoping it just passes.",
