      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's a relief to hear it might just be the migraine. i've had them before and they always freak me out for a bit. do you think i should just take some of my extra strength ibuprofen and try to sleep it off? i don't really want to go to the er if i can avoid it, it's such a hassle.",
